{
    "category": "timers",
    "dependencies": [],
    "description": "Прошедшее monotonic время с момента start_ms",
    "header": "",
    "id": "core.timers.elapsed_ms",
    "includes": [
        "time.h"
    ],
    "language": "c",
    "name": "elapsed_ms",
    "origin": "core",
    "ports": {
        "input": [
            {
                "kind": "execution",
                "name": "flow_in",
                "type": "exec"
            },
            {
                "name": "start_ms",
                "type": "int"
            }
        ],
        "output": [
            {
                "kind": "execution",
                "name": "flow_out",
                "type": "exec"
            },
            {
                "name": "result",
                "type": "int"
            }
        ]
    },
    "source": "",
    "source_code": "static int dq_elapsed_ms_now_ms(void) {\n    struct timespec ts;\n    long long value = 0;\n    if (clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, &ts) != 0)\n        return 0;\n    value = (long long) ts.tv_sec * 1000LL + (long long) (ts.tv_nsec / 1000000L);\n    return (int) (value % 2147483647LL);\n}\n\nint dq_elapsed_ms(int start_ms) {\n    const int current_ms = dq_elapsed_ms_now_ms();\n    if (current_ms < start_ms)\n        return 0;\n    return current_ms - start_ms;\n}",
    "version": "1.0",
    "metadata": {
        "deltaq.doc.when_to_use": "Когда после sync step хочется сразу получить elapsed duration для stdout/log/reporting path без ручной арифметики в graph.",
        "deltaq.doc.limitations": "Linux-first helper для коротких monotonic interval measurements; при wrap-around `int` возвращает `0`, а не пытается вести долгоживущий timer state."
    }
}
